Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.54,0:01:12.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,﻿今天多美好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.54,0:01:12.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful day
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.46,0:01:15.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,适合跟我最喜欢的小动物们打个招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.46,0:01:15.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to say hello to all my favorite little critters
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.05,0:01:17.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  小虫子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.05,0:01:17.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello, little worm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.31,0:01:24.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  小蜗牛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.31,0:01:24.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello, little snail
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.15,0:01:30.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,水汪汪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.15,0:01:30.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Moisturizing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.32,0:01:36.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们好  小线虫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:36.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello, little nematodes
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.99,0:01:42.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别害羞嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.99,0:01:42.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.00,0:01:46.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有完没完
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:46.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you mind?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.21,0:01:49.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你竟然不是线虫了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.21,0:01:49.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're not a nematode anymore?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.50,0:01:51.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:51.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That means
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.04,0:01:53.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一定是有魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:53.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I must be magic
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.05,0:01:56.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我有魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.05,0:01:56.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm magic
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.92,0:01:57.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.92,0:01:57.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, pal
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.76,0:01:59.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你并没有魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:01:59.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but you're not magic
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.14,0:02:01.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就只是正好解开了一个老巫婆的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.14,0:02:01.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You just happened to break an old witch's curse
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.47,0:02:03.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是那个诅咒把我变成了线虫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.47,0:02:03.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that turned me into a nematode
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.68,0:02:04.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,懂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.68,0:02:04.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get it?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.27,0:02:07.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有个老巫婆诅咒了你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.27,0:02:07.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,An old witch cursed you?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.19,0:02:08.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.19,0:02:08.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That means
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.52,0:02:12.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你一定就是个王子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.52,0:02:12.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you must be a prince
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.27,0:02:13.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我亲了个王子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.27,0:02:13.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I kissed a prince
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.69,0:02:15.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我亲了个王子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.69,0:02:15.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I kissed a prince
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.07,0:02:15.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我亲了个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.07,0:02:15.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I kissed a--
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.74,0:02:16.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:16.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.32,0:02:17.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也不是王子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:17.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not a prince either
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.90,0:02:19.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就只是条普通鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.90,0:02:19.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm just an ordinary guy
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.11,0:02:21.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,名叫鱼兄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.11,0:02:21.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Guy Fishman
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.70,0:02:24.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那我是海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.70,0:02:24.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.66,0:02:26.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然你只是条普通鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.66,0:02:26.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So if you're just some guy
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.83,0:02:28.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛会有巫婆要诅咒你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.83,0:02:28.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,why did a witch curse you?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.54,0:02:30.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听我详细道来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.54,0:02:30.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Allow me to expound
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.50,0:02:33.59,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(778,434)}礁石影院
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.63,0:02:32.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很久以前呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.63,0:02:32.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You see, long ago
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.96,0:02:33.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我当时犯了个错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.96,0:02:33.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I made the mistake
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.92,0:02:36.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抢了电影院里仅剩的一个位子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:36.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of taking the last seat at the movie theater
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.42,0:02:37.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不幸的是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.42,0:02:37.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.72,0:02:41.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老巫婆水滴鱼雅加也要那个位子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.72,0:02:41.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the old witch Blobba Yaga wanted the same seat
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.48,0:02:55.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,占我位子  代价惨重
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.48,0:02:55.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Take my seat and pay what's owed
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.82,0:02:59.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下半辈子都变线虫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.82,0:02:59.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Live thy life as nematode
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.12,0:03:08.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,波纹转场好痒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:08.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ripple tickle
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.79,0:03:13.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你那一吻一定是破除了咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.79,0:03:13.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your kiss must have broken the spell
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.25,0:03:17.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就不用谢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:17.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then, you're welcome
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.92,0:03:19.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.92,0:03:19.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't get it
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.22,0:03:21.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我爱的就是当线虫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.22,0:03:21.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I loved being a nematode
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.34,0:03:22.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,超级爱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.34,0:03:22.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Loved it
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.51,0:03:23.76,标准-Chi,,400,0,0,,你什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.51,0:03:23.76,标准-Eng,,400,0,0,,You what?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.47,0:03:26.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我被诅咒之前  生活一团糟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.47,0:03:26.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Before I got cursed, my life was terrible
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.93,0:03:31.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,孤单又痛苦  总是心情低落
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.93,0:03:31.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was lonely, miserable, and always down in the dumps
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:31.27,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1228,920)}在 垃 圾 场
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.48,0:03:33.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我一变成了线虫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:33.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But once I became a nematode
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.48,0:03:36.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很快就被本地一个线虫群落接纳了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.48,0:03:36.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was quickly accepted by a local pack
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.07,0:03:40.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,饿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.07,0:03:40.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hungry
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.32,0:03:47.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟一位美丽的线虫女子相爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.32,0:03:47.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I fell in love with a beautiful nematode girl
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.08,0:03:52.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我终于幸福快乐了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.08,0:03:52.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was finally happy
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.75,0:03:55.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们本来今天下午就要结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.75,0:03:55.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We were gonna get married this afternoon
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.63,0:03:57.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,共同开启新生活
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:57.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and start a life together
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.50,0:03:59.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但如果我不是虫  她就不会爱我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:03:59.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But she won't love me if I'm not a worm
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.59,0:04:06.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是回垃圾填埋场继续分类垃圾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.59,0:04:06.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll just go back to sorting trash at the landfill
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.14,0:04:08.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用管我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.14,0:04:08.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.43,0:04:11.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不能丢下你幸福快乐的线虫新娘啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.43,0:04:11.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But you can't leave your happy worm bride
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.39,0:04:15.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起  都怪我破除了咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.39,0:04:15.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I broke the spell
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.81,0:04:18.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我会不惜一切代价
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.81,0:04:18.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever it takes
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.40,0:04:21.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让你重获诅咒  鱼兄
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:21.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to get you re-cursed, Guy Fishman
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.53,0:04:25.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,保证让你顺利赶上你的线虫婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.53,0:04:25.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I promise you will make it to your nematode nuptials
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.00,0:04:35.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,肯定不是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.00,0:04:35.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This can't be the right place
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.92,0:04:37.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感  感觉样子不是很
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:37.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It-It-It just doesn't seem very
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.13,0:04:38.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,巫婆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:38.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,witchy
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.88,0:04:40.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,出租船司机说就是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.88,0:04:40.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The cab driver said this is it
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.01,0:04:44.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,巫婆啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.01,0:04:44.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Witches
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.94,0:04:56.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.94,0:04:56.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.19,0:05:01.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们好  海底美丽的孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.19,0:05:01.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Greetings, beautiful sea children
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.48,0:05:02.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:02.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I help you?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.78,0:05:03.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:03.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.86,0:05:06.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们在找把我变成线虫的巫婆
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.86,0:05:04.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're looking for the witch
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.99,0:05:06.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,who turned me into a nematode
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.95,0:05:09.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过我们好像找错房子了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.95,0:05:09.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I think we may have the wrong house
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.41,0:05:10.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没找错  就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.41,0:05:10.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nah, that's me
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.83,0:05:12.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就是水滴鱼雅加
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.83,0:05:12.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm Blobba Yaga
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.62,0:05:13.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,至少从前是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.62,0:05:13.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or at least I was
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.12,0:05:17.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在我是天天花花
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.12,0:05:17.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now I'm Sky Flower
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.09,0:05:19.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,进来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.09,0:05:19.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.84,0:05:20.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,进来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:20.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.46,0:05:24.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恐怕是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.46,0:05:24.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's true
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.76,0:05:26.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我曾经是个邪恶巫婆
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.76,0:05:26.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I used to be an evil witch
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.76,0:05:29.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但是那堆诅咒跟妖法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.76,0:05:29.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But all that cursing and hexing?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.64,0:05:31.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是累死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.64,0:05:31.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So exhausting, man
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.85,0:05:32.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,茶好喝吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:32.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How's that tea?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.85,0:05:34.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,非常好喝  阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.85,0:05:34.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Very delicious, ma'am
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.60,0:05:36.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无意冒犯  女士
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.60,0:05:36.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to be rude, lady
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.44,0:05:39.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我需要你把我变回线虫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:39.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I need you to turn me back into a nematode
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.02,0:05:40.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:40.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aw man, I'm sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.69,0:05:43.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我早就不施法了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.69,0:05:43.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just don't do magic anymore
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.28,0:05:47.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我发现自己施咒是因为内心充满愤怒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.28,0:05:47.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I realized my curses came from a place of anger
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.03,0:05:50.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以就决定转而过上平静的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.03,0:05:50.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So, I decided to live a life of tranquility instead
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.87,0:05:54.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真正的魔法就是心理治疗  宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.87,0:05:54.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The real magic was therapy, baby
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.58,0:05:55.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,愤怒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.58,0:05:55.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anger, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.71,0:05:57.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那你的茶是垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.71,0:05:57.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, your tea stinks
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.71,0:06:00.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能诅咒我了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:00.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now will you curse me?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.54,0:06:02.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,鱼兄
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.54,0:06:02.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Guy Fishman
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.30,0:06:08.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.30,0:06:08.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, man
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.34,0:06:10.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一直都打算给那株灌木浇水呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.34,0:06:10.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've been meaning to water that shrub
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.68,0:06:12.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先失陪一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.68,0:06:12.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll excuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.56,0:06:16.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得开始去做每日社区服务了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.56,0:06:16.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I gotta get started on my daily community service
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.81,0:06:18.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她要骑着扫帚飞走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.81,0:06:18.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She's going to fly away on her broom
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.89,0:06:20.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就知道她还会施法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.89,0:06:20.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I knew she still did magic
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.69,0:06:27.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见  传播和平与爱去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.69,0:06:27.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Peace and love, boys
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.53,0:06:32.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来没法让你重获诅咒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.53,0:06:32.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like we can't get you re-cursed after all
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.83,0:06:34.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.83,0:06:34.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.04,0:06:36.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要不惜一切代价惹她生气
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.04,0:06:36.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever it takes to make her angry
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.83,0:06:37.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.83,0:06:37.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.13,0:06:45.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,志愿送餐服务
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:45.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Volunteer meal service
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.21,0:06:46.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.21,0:06:46.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jumpin' Jiminy
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.80,0:06:48.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,每周我最爱的一天到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.80,0:06:48.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My favorite day of the week
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.67,0:06:50.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这应该能惹火她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:50.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This oughta rile her up
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.72,0:06:54.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在能诅咒我了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.72,0:06:54.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now will you curse me?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.60,0:06:57.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.60,0:06:57.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not cool
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.14,0:07:00.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真对不起  助步器老头
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.14,0:07:00.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am so sorry, Old Man Walker
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.85,0:07:04.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那都是瑞典肉丸吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.85,0:07:04.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Were those Swedish meatballs?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.61,0:07:07.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃斯堪的纳维亚食物会害我过敏身亡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.61,0:07:07.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm deathly allergic to Scandinavian food
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.61,0:07:07.82,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 瑞典属于斯堪的纳维亚国家 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.82,0:07:10.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这位小伙子救了我一命
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:10.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This young man saved my life
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.49,0:07:11.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我干嘛了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.49,0:07:11.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I what?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.53,0:07:12.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.53,0:07:12.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Far out
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.53,0:07:15.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你做了一件大好事啊  小弟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.53,0:07:15.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now that's a good deed, brother
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.03,0:07:16.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给  助步器老头
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.03,0:07:16.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here, Old Man Walker
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.87,0:07:19.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,改吃这些墨西哥辣肉馅玉米卷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.87,0:07:19.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Take these enchiladas instead
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.71,0:07:25.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我喜欢  小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.71,0:07:25.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me gusta, señorita
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.71,0:07:25.04,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 西班牙语 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.34,0:07:33.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她在种树  为保护环境出一份力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.34,0:07:33.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She's planting trees to help the environment
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.39,0:07:35.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道这下要怎么被诅咒了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.39,0:07:35.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know exactly how to get cursed now
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.35,0:07:37.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给  照着我做
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.35,0:07:37.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here, follow my lead
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.39,0:07:43.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,战吼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.39,0:07:43.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,War cry
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.94,0:07:48.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的树啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.94,0:07:48.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My trees
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.74,0:07:54.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天天花花  千万别生气
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.74,0:07:54.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Sky Flower, don't flip your wig
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.75,0:08:01.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等下  怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:01.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, how did?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.87,0:08:03.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们做了个小小游乐场
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.87,0:08:03.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We made a little playground
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.71,0:08:05.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多么可爱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.71,0:08:05.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How sweet
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.05,0:08:13.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们又在陪我一起做好事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.05,0:08:13.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You were doing another good deed with me?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.76,0:08:15.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这我倒喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.76,0:08:15.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now that I dig
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.05,0:08:17.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,奖励你们一人一块饼干
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.05,0:08:17.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cookies for both of you
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.89,0:08:19.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.89,0:08:19.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.23,0:08:22.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,鱼兄  等等
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.23,0:08:22.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Guy, wait
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.15,0:08:25.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.15,0:08:25.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, ma'am
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.78,0:08:33.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很遗憾水滴鱼雅加太温和了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.78,0:08:33.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry Blobba Yaga is too mellow
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.24,0:08:34.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没法重新诅咒你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:34.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to re-curse you
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.36,0:08:37.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来不被诅咒是我注定要中的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.36,0:08:37.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It seems I've been cursed to go uncursed
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.62,0:08:38.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还不算太糟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:38.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that's not too bad
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.49,0:08:41.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过也许还有其他办法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.49,0:08:41.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But maybe there's something else we can do
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.62,0:08:42.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,算了吧  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.62,0:08:42.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Forget it, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.87,0:08:44.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我婚礼一小时后开始
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.87,0:08:44.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My wedding's in an hour
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.54,0:08:46.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在那之前根本变不成线虫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:46.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll never be a nematode by then
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.00,0:08:49.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得回归我从前的一生了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:49.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, it's back to my old life
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.88,0:08:52.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下一站  市垃圾场
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.88,0:08:52.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Next stop, city dump
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.60,0:08:58.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,水滴鱼雅加
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.60,0:08:58.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Blobba Yaga?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.10,0:09:00.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是说  天天花花
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.10,0:09:00.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean, Sky Flower?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.72,0:09:01.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你自行车怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:01.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What happened to your bike?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.10,0:09:03.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,爆胎了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:03.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Flat tire, man
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.48,0:09:04.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定是被刺扎破了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:04.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Musta hit a splinter
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.77,0:09:09.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,每到这时候我都希望自己有带扫帚来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.77,0:09:09.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Times like these I wish I brought my broomstick
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.32,0:09:14.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.32,0:09:14.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, see ya
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.75,0:09:32.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  女士
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.75,0:09:32.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, lady
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.05,0:09:32.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,公交满员了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.05,0:09:32.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bus is full
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.92,0:09:36.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下一趟要等六小时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:36.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Next one's in six hours
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.06,0:09:46.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,鱼兄  我受够你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:46.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Guy Fishman, I've had it with you
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.81,0:09:50.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,占我位子  你生活告终
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.81,0:09:50.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Take my seat, and you're done for
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.94,0:09:55.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让你再次变成线虫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.94,0:09:55.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thou shall be a nematode once more
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.45,0:10:00.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.45,0:10:00.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.28,0:10:02.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.28,0:10:02.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.08,0:10:04.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能不能坐好啊  女士
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:04.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can you sit down now, ma'am?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.91,0:10:06.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别吵
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.91,0:10:06.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Silence
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.04,0:10:08.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这点工资不够我受这种气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.04,0:10:08.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They don't pay me enough
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.13,0:10:11.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,变线虫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.13,0:10:11.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nematode
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.88,0:10:13.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,变线虫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.88,0:10:13.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nematode
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.25,0:10:14.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,变线虫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.25,0:10:14.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nematode
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.80,0:10:17.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,鱼兄
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.80,0:10:17.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Guy
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.68,0:10:20.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她把你变回线虫了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.68,0:10:20.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She turned you back into a nematode
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.18,0:10:22.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天一定是你这辈子最美好的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.18,0:10:22.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This must be the best day of your life
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.64,0:10:24.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.64,0:10:24.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wedding
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.72,0:10:25.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:25.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.31,0:10:26.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还能赶得上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.31,0:10:26.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We can still make it
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.27,0:10:29.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,变线虫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:29.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nematode
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.65,0:10:31.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,变线虫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.65,0:10:31.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nematode
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.07,0:10:35.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家快看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.07,0:10:35.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, look, everyone
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.48,0:10:38.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,做好事的好心老太太回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.48,0:10:38.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The kind old woman who does good deeds is back
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.70,0:10:39.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,变线虫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.70,0:10:39.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nematode
