Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.53,0:10:43.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nematode
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.58,0:10:50.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.58,0:10:50.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hola, mi amor
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.54,0:10:52.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,变线虫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.54,0:10:52.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nematode
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.96,0:10:55.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:10:55.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,¿Por qué?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.55,0:10:58.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,鱼兄  你是否愿意接受这只线虫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.55,0:10:58.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you, Guy Fishman, take this nematode
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.09,0:11:00.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,成为你合法的线虫妻子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.09,0:11:00.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to be your lawfully wedded wormy wife?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.47,0:11:03.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.47,0:11:03.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I do
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.10,0:11:06.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我现在宣布你们结为线虫夫妻
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.10,0:11:06.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I now pronounce you worm and worm
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.18,0:11:08.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你可以吻线虫新娘了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.18,0:11:08.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You may kiss the worm
