Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.06,0:11:51.98,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(694,330)}拉里健身房
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.52,0:11:57.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,﻿举起杠铃  你真行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.52,0:11:57.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lift that weight, you're doing great
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.27,0:11:58.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  拉里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.27,0:11:58.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Larry
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.99,0:12:04.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一分疼痛一分收获啊  韦恩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:04.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No pain no gain, Wayne
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.07,0:12:05.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  拉里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.07,0:12:05.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Larry
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.24,0:12:11.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,女生举哑铃  我的世界都震惊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.24,0:12:11.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Girls doing curls rocks my world
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.42,0:12:16.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我又大又壮  那么说很恰当
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.42,0:12:16.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm big and strong and that ain't wrong
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.50,0:12:19.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拉里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.50,0:12:19.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Larry
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.38,0:12:20.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.38,0:12:20.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Check me out
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.88,0:12:24.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也在举重
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.88,0:12:24.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm pumping iron too
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.88,0:12:24.72,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1056,920)}熨 斗
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.80,0:12:28.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个  海绵兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.80,0:12:28.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Sponge-bro
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.68,0:12:30.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想问的是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.68,0:12:30.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've been meaning to ask
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.06,0:12:32.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要做家务能不能回自己家做
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.06,0:12:32.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,can you do your housework at home?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.85,0:12:37.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星又怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.85,0:12:37.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And what's with Patrick?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.65,0:12:40.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他有会员  却从来不健身
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.65,0:12:40.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's got a membership but he never works out
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.15,0:12:43.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就只吃贩卖机卖的花生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.15,0:12:43.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He just eats peanuts from the vending machine
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.11,0:12:45.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对了  他发疯似的想吃花生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.11,0:12:45.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, he goes nuts for peanuts
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.75,0:12:52.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,花生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:52.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Peanut
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.79,0:12:56.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,花生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.79,0:12:56.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Peanut?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.79,0:13:00.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.79,0:13:00.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Whoa
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.75,0:13:03.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,划啊划啊  划小船
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.75,0:13:03.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Row, row, row your boat
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.43,0:13:06.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,花生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.43,0:13:06.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Peanut?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.09,0:13:08.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我了个去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.09,0:13:08.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Double whoa
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.06,0:13:13.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.06,0:13:13.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where'd it go?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.73,0:13:15.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:15.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.35,0:13:18.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他肌肉根本就不结实
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.35,0:13:18.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's got absolutely no muscle tone
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.69,0:13:20.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么可能会举起这么大的重量
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.69,0:13:20.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How can he lift so much weight?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.23,0:13:21.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,简单
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.23,0:13:21.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Easy
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.90,0:13:24.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星不知道自己举不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.90,0:13:24.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick doesn't know that he can't lift it
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.53,0:13:25.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.53,0:13:25.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Doesn't know?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.74,0:13:28.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星无视了物理定律
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.74,0:13:28.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick's ignorance of the laws of physics
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.20,0:13:30.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以力气才会特别大吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:30.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,allows him to be extra powerful?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.91,0:13:31.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.91,0:13:31.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.83,0:13:34.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对了  我还给派大星报名了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:34.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,By the way, I signed Patrick up for
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:37.75,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1410,216)}举重大赛
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.75,0:13:37.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明天办的年度举重大赛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.75,0:13:37.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the annual Weightlifting Games tomorrow
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.75,0:13:40.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可拉里的照片在海报上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.75,0:13:40.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But Larry's picture's on the poster
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.50,0:13:42.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拉里每年都赢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.50,0:13:42.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Larry wins every year
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.38,0:13:44.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拉里不能让派大星赢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.38,0:13:44.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Larry can't let Patrick win
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.67,0:13:49.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拉里要咋得到派大星那样的无脑神力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.67,0:13:49.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How does Larry get brainless brawn like Patrick?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.55,0:13:51.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.55,0:13:51.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got it
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.01,0:13:54.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要跟踪派大星  照搬他的训练过程
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.01,0:13:54.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll follow Patrick and copy his training
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.18,0:13:56.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天不练腿了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.18,0:13:56.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm skipping Leg Day
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.89,0:13:59.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天练无脑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.89,0:13:59.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Today is Brainless Day
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.81,0:14:01.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,穿好裤子吧你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.81,0:14:01.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And put some pants on
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.32,0:14:09.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.32,0:14:09.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.45,0:14:11.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢你模仿我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.45,0:14:11.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't appreciate you imitating me
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.20,0:14:12.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.20,0:14:12.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.20,0:14:15.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不长那样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:15.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't look like that
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.04,0:14:18.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我声音也不是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:18.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I don't sound like that
Dialogue: 1,0:14:19.92,0:14:22.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就用那个让你长点记性
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.92,0:14:22.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let that be a lesson to you
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.96,0:14:26.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太疯狂了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.96,0:14:26.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is nuts
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.47,0:14:27.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过还是试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.47,0:14:27.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But here goes
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.80,0:14:32.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛啊  你这疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.80,0:14:32.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you doin', you crazy?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.51,0:14:33.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放松  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.51,0:14:33.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Relax, bro
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.85,0:14:35.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天我得练无脑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.85,0:14:35.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it's Brainless Day
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.73,0:14:37.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.73,0:14:37.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.48,0:14:39.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我再砸几下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.48,0:14:39.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just a few more reps
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.65,0:14:45.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,假如疼痛是收获
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.65,0:14:45.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If pain is gain
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.69,0:14:47.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那拉里收获满满
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.69,0:14:47.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Larry's in a world of gain
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.54,0:15:01.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这一定就是他的食疗方案
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.54,0:15:01.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This must be his diet regimen
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.14,0:15:14.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都烂掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.14,0:15:14.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's putrid
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.48,0:15:21.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.48,0:15:21.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yuck
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.94,0:15:30.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想练肌肉就得这么干  小兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.94,0:15:28.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is what you gotta do
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.15,0:15:30.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to get your muscles pumped, little bros
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.45,0:15:40.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也得去洗胃了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.45,0:15:40.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need my stomach pumped too
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.45,0:15:40.16,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1026,920)}练
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.46,0:15:48.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,捉水母很适合健身
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.46,0:15:48.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jellyfishing is great exercise
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.88,0:15:52.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是捉水母怎么会让我又壮又无脑呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.88,0:15:52.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But how can jellyfishing make me strong and brainless?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.69,0:16:03.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,古怪  非主流
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.69,0:16:03.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eccentric, unorthodox
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.94,0:16:05.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又无脑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.94,0:16:05.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and brainless
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.52,0:16:07.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拉里懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.52,0:16:07.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now Larry sees
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.86,0:16:11.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抓起来吧  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.86,0:16:11.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go get 'em, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.92,0:16:30.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好硬核
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.92,0:16:30.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So hardcore
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.21,0:16:33.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,水母把他蜇得肌肉发达
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.21,0:16:33.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The jelly stings have made him super swole
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.21,0:16:33.55,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1226,920)}肿
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.18,0:16:39.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.18,0:16:39.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, here goes
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.23,0:16:47.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.23,0:16:47.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Neptune's nose hairs
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.90,0:16:49.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好大一只
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.90,0:16:49.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're a big boy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:50.44,0:16:52.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要蜇就快蜇  水母兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.44,0:16:52.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just do it, jelly dude
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.82,0:16:55.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的四头肌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.82,0:16:55.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My quads
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.32,0:16:57.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的腹肌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.32,0:16:57.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My abs
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.12,0:17:06.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那股疼痛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.12,0:17:06.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The burn
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.42,0:17:07.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那股燃烧感
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.42,0:17:07.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The burn
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.71,0:17:09.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我感受到了神力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.71,0:17:09.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I feel the brawny
Dialogue: 1,0:17:10.42,0:17:12.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在燃烧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.42,0:17:12.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,burn
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.64,0:17:18.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早睡是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.64,0:17:18.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Early to bed, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.55,0:17:21.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,整晚睡个好觉有利身心健康
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.55,0:17:21.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A good night's sleep is great for the mind and body
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.89,0:17:23.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但这样无脑吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.89,0:17:23.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But is it brainless?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.02,0:17:28.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.02,0:17:28.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Leapin' lampreys
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.90,0:17:30.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他被压扁了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.90,0:17:30.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's been crushed
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.11,0:17:33.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等下  拉里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.11,0:17:33.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, Larry
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.19,0:17:38.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这可能是某种提升肌张力的新锻炼法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.19,0:17:38.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This could be some sort of new isometric exercise
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.95,0:17:41.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他的肌肉会抵抗石头的重量
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.95,0:17:41.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,His muscles work against the weight of the rock
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.54,0:17:43.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让他在睡觉时得到锻炼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:43.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to build strength while he sleeps
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.83,0:17:46.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,简直大智若愚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.83,0:17:46.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's so simple it's genius
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.92,0:17:51.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这块应该行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.92,0:17:51.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This'll do
