Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.60,0:18:03.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Son of a monkey
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.35,0:18:04.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:04.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This hurts
