Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.90,0:21:02.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,体育迷们  展现了如此强大的力量后
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.90,0:21:02.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fans, with an incredible feat of strength
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.20,0:21:06.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,连续二十五年
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.20,0:21:06.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for the 25th straight year in a row
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.57,0:21:11.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裤头村举重大赛二十五连冠是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.57,0:21:11.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the winner of the Bikini Bottom Weightlifting Games
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.50,0:21:15.62,标准-Chi,,0,300,0,,龙虾拉里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.50,0:21:15.62,标准-Eng,,0,300,0,,Larry the Lobster
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.63,0:21:22.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  可以拿下那颗花生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.63,0:21:22.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, SpongeBob, can you get that peanut?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.76,0:21:24.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我亲爱的拉里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.76,0:21:24.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, my dear Larry
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.55,0:21:27.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,花生只是用来激励你的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.55,0:21:27.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The peanut was only a motivation
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.14,0:21:28.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你已经赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.14,0:21:28.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You've already won
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.89,0:21:30.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你向来都很强壮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.89,0:21:30.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You were always strong
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.47,0:21:32.64,标准-Chi,,0,500,0,,但举起整座城市
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.47,0:21:32.64,标准-Eng,,0,500,0,,but lifting the entire city
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.64,0:21:34.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,简直大智若愚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.64,0:21:34.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,was a smart move
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.85,0:21:36.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大智若愚吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.85,0:21:36.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Smart?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.39,0:21:37.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.39,0:21:37.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.27,0:21:38.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.27,0:21:38.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I see
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.56,0:21:40.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,花生激励法
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.56,0:21:40.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Peanut motivation
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.23,0:21:43.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我并不无脑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.23,0:21:43.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not brainless
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.32,0:21:44.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我大智若愚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.32,0:21:44.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm smart
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.79,0:21:53.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我很强壮没错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.79,0:21:53.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm strong alright
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.41,0:21:55.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且我还大智若愚  可以知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.41,0:21:55.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I'm smart enough to know
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.33,0:21:58.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拉里举不起整座裤头村
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.33,0:21:58.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that Larry can't hold up all of Bikini Bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.63,0:22:00.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.63,0:22:00.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You better run
